      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Yes. The peoples of Europe possess a fundamental right to safeguard and perpetuate their own ethnocultural continuity. This is the core mission of @SaveEuropeAct.\n\nCorrect me if I’m mistaken, but @RestoreBritain appears to be the only political party that recognizes Europe, specifically the United Kingdom in this case, as home to distinct yet connected ethnicities, each of which deserves protection.\n\nThis is the way.",
