          {
            "height": 3240,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW2UPu0W4AE0scz.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 3240
          }
        ],
        "name": "Rupert Lowe MP",
        "text": "I have tabled a parliamentary motion officially calling on the Government to recognise and protect English, Scottish, Welsh and Northern Irish ethnicities as distinct historic identities.\n\nWe should never be ashamed to defend who we are.\n\nAll MPs have been invited to support.",
        "url": "https://x.com/RupertLowe10/status/2120514146638643264",
