            "width": 1536
          }
        ],
        "name": "Eva Vlaardingerbroek",
        "text": "Was supposed to be joining @RupertLowe10 for a @RestoreBritain event tonight. If I had travelled to the UK, I would have been arrested on the spot and could have faced up to 4 years in prison.\n\nI can’t visit for one day to give a speech, yet thousands of people without papers cross the Channel and are given free housing and citizenship.\n\nAll courtesy of @ShabanaMahmood and the @ukhomeoffice.",
        "url": "https://x.com/EvaVlaar/status/2120205452101259705",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": {
