      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Great to see @Alice_Weidel double down on the AfD’s remigration position after Tino Chrupalla and Maximilian Krah confused the electorate with misplaced comments blaming the Republicans’ election losses on ICE and how Remigration on a mass scale is impossible.\n\nShe rightly corrects the record: it was broken promises on foreign wars and gas prices, not their immigration policy, that cost them the elections.\n\nWeidel has previously made clear she would send back all Syrians and Afghans once the grounds for their stay no longer apply. Those groups alone number in the millions, not the 200k Krah is limiting the discussion to.",
