      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "The largest, most energetic patriotic pan-European NGO to have ever existed. \n\nWe have a mission: To make sure Europe remains Europeans. \n\nJoin us.\nhttps://save-europe-act.com",
      "quote": {
        "author": "JonaLionDE",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2076754404238102528/O6XlC-n7_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-08 03:52:10",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-07T19:52:10.000Z",
        "id": "2119155970597073191",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWjAqzmXYAAgBm8.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 2048,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWjAqzmXYAAgBm8.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 1366
          }
        ],
        "name": "Jona Lion",
        "text": "The three biggest achievements after five months of Save Europe Act\n\n1. We have created an opportunity to turn conviction into action. With a low barrier-of-entry, anyone can connect with one of our regional leaders across Europe (97 and counting) and get active at any time.\n\n2. We have built an alliance for remigration. Save Europe Act unites people from different nations, political parties, and groups to save our nations.\n\n3. We have built an unprecedented patriotic mobilisation database. In under 24 hours, we can mobilise our network of 800.000+ signers, 6.000+ volunteers and 100+ key opinion leaders (politicians, influencers, and experts) to join our campaign with a unified message and achieve metapolitical wins.\n\nThank you to everyone working tirelessly on Saving Europe, this is just the beginning!",
        "url": "https://x.com/JonaLionDE/status/2119155970597073191",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
